    "batch_4": "15 uniformly random traces from the 235 unreviewed traces, drawn after the six candidate modes were drafted, to check whether new modes continue to appear. No suggestions are attached and the traces are reviewed blind (no mode names shown while reading). The draw contains no write-tool traces (the unreviewed pool is 6% write), so it cannot test the write mode. Seed 7."
